# 部署目标是 Ubuntu：仓库内容与工作树一律 LF，禁止 Windows 侧改写
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# 二进制资产不做换行/BOM 处理
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# 供应商化基线：按字节原样保存，禁止任何 EOL/编码转换（否则包内 SHA256 校验失效）
spec/** -text
